# MQ06 "Dagon Shrine". MQ05 100 set MQ06 10: the shrine is in Lake Arrius Caverns. Entering sets 20; the
# Doorkeeper takes the password (30); Harrow takes the initiate's possessions (40) and leads to the shrine, where
# Mankar Camoran speaks (45) and leaves through his portal to Paradise with the Amulet (49, 50). Ruma offers the
# sacrifice; refusing sets 51 and the shrine attacks. Taking the Mysterium Xarxes from the altar sets 60, leaving
# the caverns 70, Jauffre's welcome at Cloud Ruler 80, and Martin's "Can the Xarxes lead us to Camoran?" 100.
# DRAFT from tools/live/quest_brief.py (2026-11-12): not run yet.

# The ride to Lake Arrius is the player's travel: moveto the Doorkeeper stands in. MQ06Script sets 20 once the
# player is in LakeArriusCaverns. The Doorkeeper's greeting offers "Greet the new day." (INFO 0001F10B / 0001F874,
# 30).
case mq06_doorkeeper
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 10
run
player.moveto MQ06MythicDawnDoorkeeperRef
until 600 GetStage MQ06 >= 20
approach MQ06MythicDawnDoorkeeperRef
talk MQ06MythicDawnDoorkeeperRef
ask "Greet the new day."
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 30
bye if open
end

# Harrow, behind the door: his greeting offers "[Give him all your possessions]" (INFO 0001F168, MQ06 < 40), which
# sets 40: everything goes to Harrow and the player wears the initiate's robe.
case mq06_harrow
run
player.moveto HarrowRef
wait 120
approach HarrowRef
talk HarrowRef
ask "[Give him all your possessions]"
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 40
expect player.GetItemCount MythicDawnRobe >= 1
bye if open
end

# Harrow leads to the shrine (LakeArriusShrineDagon); MQ06Script sets 45 once the player is within 2500 of Mankar
# Camoran there. He speaks and leaves by the portal (MQ06ParadisePortalScript: 49, then 50). Following Harrow is
# the player's walk: moveto Camoran stands in.
case mq06_camoran_speech
run
player.moveto MankarCamoranRef
until 600 GetStage MQ06 >= 45
until 3600 GetStage MQ06 >= 49
until 1800 GetStage MQ06 >= 50
end

# Ruma's greeting at 50 offers the sacrifice of Jeelius; "No, I will not kill for you." (INFO 00024EA2) sets 51
# and the shrine attacks. The player fights (`defend`) and takes the Mysterium Xarxes from the altar (placed book
# 0001E746 in LakeArriusShrineDagon; MysteriumXarxesScript OnAdd sets 60).
case mq06_take_xarxes
defend
approach RumaRef
talk RumaRef
ask "No, I will not kill for you."
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 51
bye if open
run
player.moveto 0001E746
wait 60
take 0001E746
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 60
end

# Out of the caverns (70, MQ06Script) and back to Cloud Ruler Temple; the ride is the player's travel. Jauffre's
# greeting (INFO 00020073, MQ06 >= 60) sets 80 and offers "No. Mankar Camoran escaped with it.", whose answer offers
# "Maybe. I have the Mysterium Xarxes." (INFO 0008B617; Goodbye stays locked until it is answered); Martin: "No. But I
# have the Mysterium Xarxes." offers "Can the Xarxes lead us to Camoran?" (INFO 0008B619), which sets 100.
case mq06_return_martin
defend
run
player.moveto JauffreRef
until 900 GetStage MQ06 >= 70
approach JauffreRef
talk JauffreRef
until 300 GetStage MQ06 >= 80
ask "No. Mankar Camoran escaped with it."
ask "Maybe. I have the Mysterium Xarxes."
bye if open
run
player.moveto MartinRef
wait 120
approach MartinRef
talk MartinRef
ask "No. But I have the Mysterium Xarxes."
ask "Can the Xarxes lead us to Camoran?"
until 300 GetStageDone MQ06 100
bye if open
end
